            <title>0.18.30</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:15:02 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.30</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.30</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.30</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>The macOS permission question no longer fires a pill</strong> — the first time you turn an App volume dial, macOS asks for permission. Moving the pointer to that question could open a pill on the way. Rayto now ignores the pointer until you have answered.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
