        <item>
            <title>0.18.29</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:11:23 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.29</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.29</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.29</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>A dial&#x27;s second action shows its own app</strong> — rest the pointer on an App volume dial and switch to its second action. The dial&#x27;s centre now shows the second action&#x27;s app at once. Before, it kept the first app until you moved the pointer.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
